   "text": "Thank you, Helen. I've verified your account and looked at order K-9601 from Lotus Garden.\n\nI can't issue a credit or refund for the pad see ew myself. Your account is flagged for a review under our policy because of the number of recent support refunds. I've passed your request to a specialist (reference ESC-700), who will follow up within 24 hours. I haven't applied any credit or refund in the meantime.\n\nIs there anything else I can help you with tonight?"
